# 行尾统一：版本库内一律 LF；Windows 专用脚本检出为 CRLF（cmd/PowerShell 对 LF 敏感）
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.psm1 text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

# 二进制：禁止行尾转换与文本 diff
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.node binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
*.zstd binary
*.pfx binary
*.p12 binary
*.cer binary

# 文书：显式声明 UTF-8 文本，便于 GitHub 识别与 diff
*.md text
*.json text
*.yml text
*.yaml text
